<p class="eyebrow">Fortress revival &middot; coordinator skill &middot; skill drafts &middot; version 26 &middot; 8 November 2026</p>
<h1>Held rule drafts, version 26</h1>
<p class="standfirst">Version 26. One landed change waits for the curator&rsquo;s reading, item 34, and no draft waits for the curator&rsquo;s yes. The curator read items 30 and 31 at 23:20 UTC on 7 November, and drafts 32 and 33 landed as approved at 23:24 UTC.</p>
</header>

