<li>Change 34: commits of 8 November, <code>71272d748</code>, 15:32 UTC, &ldquo;coordinator: an unread page item shows the current text; a later change folds into it&rdquo;, and <code>624b7a79e</code>, 15:38 UTC, &ldquo;coordinator: one home for the folded-item rule, and the form of a folded item&rdquo;, the fixes after its cold read. Shown against the text at <code>ba5f46eee</code>. The curator&rsquo;s comment of 07:15 UTC on 8 November, on change 39 of the page of <code>fortress-repo</code> changes, thread <code>4e0493d3</code>. Its provenance: <code>references/sources.md</code>, &ldquo;An unread page item shows the current text, 2026-11-08&rdquo; and &ldquo;The cold read of <code>71272d7484</code>, 2026-11-08&rdquo;.</li>
</ul>
</div>
