<section id="s2" class="part">
<h2>Proposed changes</h2>
<p>No draft waits for the curator&rsquo;s yes. The curator approved drafts 32 and 33 at 23:24 UTC on 7 November 2026, and they landed as approved in commit <code>c6122149</code>, with no word changed.</p>
